  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>基岩強化模組&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>新增一種基岩變體，可與獄髓裝備結合使用。&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>不純基岩方塊可在世界最低層（-58 至 -64）取得。&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>熔煉此方塊可獲得不純基岩碎片</strong></span></p><p><strong>利用此碎片可製作不純基岩錠</strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4XQg4DM.png\" alt=\"不純基岩碎片\" width=\"262\" height=\"135\"></strong></p><p><strong>將此錠與獄髓工具及裝備結合，可強化你的裝備，例如：</strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GOzRhKj.png\" alt=\"合成配方\" width=\"337\" height=\"133\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>效果：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>穿戴整套不純基岩裝備時，將獲得「抗性（無限）」升級效果，僅限完整套裝時生效</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">部分翻譯為自動生成！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.net%252faff.php%253faff%253d127\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RJPr4Ij.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"316\"></a></span></p>",
